y all necessities. Warning: this location is in the middle of touristville so it gets very busy on weekends/during events"},{"business_id":"tc_W6eDhP1HyjIwQ4z3XIg","review_id":"1g2XEzlp7A5LkIaj-5dpMQ","date":"2011-06-08T01:16:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8661412000656128,"text_excerpt":"Simple if you need water, touristy crap or meds go here. Everything is cheaper here and is the same or better then in the main stores in the FQ. Also the people working were nice and helpful with directions."},{"business_id":"tc_W6eDhP1HyjIwQ4z3XIg","review_id":"PLDaAlMfnlvJVVGgCUKhgw","date":"2010-04-30T20:00:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8553025722503662,"text_excerpt":"Hooray for Walgreens! Hooray for having rain ponchos, umbrellas, and all the other rain gear we didn't bring with us ....cause a basic raincoat didn't cut it this year. We're talking the wet, wetter, wettest Jazzfest we've been to in forever! And don't even start thinking the Walgreens fabulousity stops there. You've also got sunblock, foldy chairs, flipflops, and all the Jazzfest wares you can think of Munchies? They've got snacks galore from salty to sweet Thirsty? All the drinkys you can think of from soda to beer Trust me, it's all found here - and best part is their checkout lines moving super fast to get you back towards your party destination in no time Woot!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"tc_W6eDhP1HyjIwQ4z3XIg","photo_id":"XKQCsIISzKgZWwFP0bSA8w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/XKQCsIISzKgZWwFP0bSA8w.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
